# CODEOWNERS — who must approve changes to which paths.
# Branch protection requires a code owner's approval before merging to main.
#
# Set to the supervisor's GitHub username. To add a co-supervisor (e.g. the doctor),
# list both: `*  @omaramir2001 @doctor-username` (either one's approval counts).
# Every team repo created from the template inherits this file.
#
# Pick ONE mode. Later rules override earlier ones for the same path.

# ── Strict mode (default): the instructor approves every PR ─────────────────
*                       @omaramir2001

# ── Light mode: teammates approve most PRs, the instructor owns what matters ─
# To switch: delete the `*` line above and uncomment the block below.
# PRs touching only files with no owner then need ONE approval from anyone
# with write access (a teammate). PRs touching the paths below still need yours.
